   The original source code of Photo Manager is licensed under the MIT License below.
   You are free to use, modify, and redistribute it without any special demands from
   the author (provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind).

2. [IMPORTANT] Third-Party Packages & Data Licenses:
   If you modify, redistribute, or bundle this software, **you MUST strictly comply
   with the licenses of all bundled/used third-party packages and datasets!**
   Please see `LICENSES/NOTICE.txt` and the `LICENSES/` directory for full details
   (including LGPL 2.1 requirements for LibRaw/rawpy and CC BY 4.0 / ODbL attribution
   for offline geocoding data).
